# EchLub Work Packages

Collaboration model: **Bounded Autonomous Work Packages with Owner Gates**.

## Agent responsibility

Within an authorized work package, agents may: preflight, inspect, plan, implement, test, self-review, specialist review, bounded correction, evidence packaging.

Stop at the declared stop gate. Do not self-approve owner acceptance.

## Git rules

Unless explicitly authorized: no staging, commit, push, force push, amend, rebase, tag, or deletion of unrelated artifacts.

## Evidence policy

- Actual diff is authoritative over model reports.
- Separate human decision packet from detailed machine evidence.
- Prototype claims must distinguish implemented, visually observed, inferred, and unverified behavior.
